{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Sicilian Eggplant Ragu",
  "description": "A sour and tender solo dinner Italian dish featuring starch and a mirepoix base, this vegetarian friendly ragu is served in a ramekin. It is a traditional Sicilian recipe with a twist.",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
